Package: introTree
Title: Tree-Aware Filtering of D-Statistic Tables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ruben", "Muller-Perol", email = "rubenmullerperol@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Filters tables of D-statistic (ABBA-BABA test) results so that
    only trios whose H1 and H2 pairing agrees with a rooted species tree are
    kept. Tools such as 'ANGSD' report a result for every arrangement of each
    trio, but only the arrangement matching the species tree is interpretable
    as a test for gene flow. Trees are read and rooted with 'ape'. P-values
    and Benjamini-Hochberg adjusted p-values are reported for information;
    significance is based on a Z-score threshold. The D-statistic is
    described in Durand et al. (2011) <doi:10.1093/molbev/msr048>.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/RMP-deb/introTree
BugReports: https://github.com/RMP-deb/introTree/issues
